{"version":1,"content":"<p>【天啊 😂】自從有了 AI 之後，以前不可能的任務都變得有可能。</p><p>近日，獨立開發者 makrotasuss（Makr）在 AI 協助下，成功在小米旗下 Redmi Note 12 智能手機上原生載入並運行 Apple iOS 16 作業系統，引起開源及越獄社群的高度關注。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:19:24.010243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:08:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:05.911989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:44.994124+00:00","content_hash":"5119651692b68b6e0944de671e838f06df2b72bd8ca9f7abb602504d63d773f7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}